    "A calm system built around focus, consistency and visible progress.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una forma tranquila de estudiar con constancia y ver todo lo que avanzas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A colourful Japanese-inspired bowl built around sweet and savoury teriyaki, fresh vegetables and warm rice. Each ingredient represents the focus you brought to the sessions that grew it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bowl de inspiración japonesa con teriyaki dulce y salado, verduras frescas y arroz caliente. Cada ingrediente representa la concentración de las sesiones que lo hicieron crecer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A comforting ramen bowl topped with crisp katsu, a soft egg and fresh greens. It grew one focused session at a time until every part of the bowl was complete.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un reconfortante ramen con katsu crujiente, huevo tierno y verduras frescas. Creció sesión a sesión hasta quedar completo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh week": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una nueva semana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A good start": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un buen comienzo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A level 5 bowl becomes part of your permanent collection.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bowl de nivel 5 pasa a formar parte de tu colección para siempre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little focus. A big change.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un poco de concentración. Un gran cambio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little more learned. A little more earned.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un poco más aprendido. Un poco más ganado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little progress each day builds a lasting habit.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un poco de progreso cada día crea un hábito duradero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little progress every day!": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¡Un poco de progreso cada día!"
          }
