    },
    "A purchase is already being processed. Finish or cancel it, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya hay una compra en curso. Termínala o cancélala antes de volver a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A vibrant chirashi bowl layered with salmon, tuna, prawns, egg and fresh vegetables over rice. Every focused session adds another colourful part to the finished bowl.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un chirashi lleno de color con salmón, atún, gambas, huevo y verduras frescas sobre arroz. Cada sesión de concentración añade una nueva parte al bowl final."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A warming Japanese curry filled with tofu and colourful vegetables. Its bright blue bowl and rich golden curry grew fuller with every focused hour.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un cálido curry japonés con tofu y verduras llenas de color. El bowl azul y el intenso curry dorado se fueron llenando con cada hora de concentración."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this bowl": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sobre este bowl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "According to various studies on university students,": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Según diversos estudios realizados con estudiantes universitarios,"
