    "Business": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empresa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "But more than the app itself, what I’ll take away from Shipaton is the process of building it. There were plenty of things I didn’t know how to do, and a lot of moments where I wasn’t sure I would manage to finish. Figuring things out one by one and watching Yutori slowly become real has been one of the most rewarding things I’ve done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pero, más allá de la app, de Shipaton me quedo con todo el proceso de construirla. Había muchísimas cosas que no sabía hacer y más de una vez dudé de si conseguiría terminarla. Ir resolviendo cada problema y ver cómo Yutori iba tomando forma poco a poco ha sido de las cosas más gratificantes que he hecho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
