    "I had wanted to learn how to make apps for a long time, but I kept putting it off. I was always waiting for the right moment, or until I felt ready enough to start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llevaba mucho tiempo queriendo aprender a hacer apps, pero siempre lo iba dejando. Esperaba a que llegara el momento perfecto o a sentir que ya estaba preparado para empezar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I joined Shipaton with a pretty simple goal: **finally build something.**": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me apunté a Shipaton con un objetivo bastante sencillo: **construir algo de una vez.**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I wanted to make something that was actually mine, learn as much as possible along the way, and see what I could build in a limited amount of time. That’s how Yutori started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quería crear algo que sintiera realmente mío, aprender todo lo posible por el camino y ver hasta dónde podía llegar en tan poco tiempo. Así empezó Yutori."
          }
        }
      }
    },
