    "Thanks for being here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gracias por acompañarme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s why we made Yutori.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por eso creamos Yutori."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The challenge that turned Yutori from an idea into a real app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El reto que convirtió una idea en una app de verdad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The idea came from something very familiar to me: studying. I wanted to experiment with making the process feel a little more rewarding and give people a reason to come back every day. The idea of growing and collecting Japanese bowls felt simple, but fun enough to turn studying into something you could actually look forward to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La idea salió de algo muy cercano para mí: estudiar. Quería que el esfuerzo se sintiera un poco más gratificante y tener un pequeño motivo para volver cada día. Hacer crecer y coleccionar bowls japoneses me pareció una idea sencilla, pero lo bastante divertida como para que estudiar apeteciera un poco más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name came from the Japanese word **Yutori (ゆとり)**, which can mean *space, room, or breathing room*, especially mentally. I liked the idea of connecting that feeling with learning, growth, and taking the time to improve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El nombre viene de la palabra japonesa **Yutori (ゆとり)**, que habla de tener *espacio, margen o un poco de aire*, sobre todo mental. Me gustó porque encajaba con la idea de aprender, crecer y darse tiempo para mejorar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sessions connected to this bowl are no longer in your history.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las sesiones vinculadas a este bowl ya no están en tu historial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "THE STORY OF SHIPATON '26": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LA HISTORIA DE SHIPATON '26"
          }
        }
      }
    },
